00:03:40.079 --> 00:03:41.079
That's not how these things work.

00:03:41.079 --> 00:03:44.680
It's not Trump getting on the phone with Putin
and saying, how can we work together to, to

00:03:44.680 --> 00:03:46.090
help me win?

00:03:46.090 --> 00:03:49.900
This is just a good reminder that sometimes
we've got to zoom out to understand the picture

00:03:49.900 --> 00:03:54.779
of what's going on and the context, uh, and
get away from the minutia that often becomes

00:03:54.779 --> 00:03:57.489
the focus in many analyses of the molar report.

